550
00:29:54,381 --> 00:29:57,980
Monster trucks were born out of a 1970s trend

551
00:29:57,981 --> 00:30:01,420
that took pickup trucks and SUVs and modified them

552
00:30:01,421 --> 00:30:05,260
with massive axles and tires, mashing up trucks

553
00:30:05,261 --> 00:30:07,420
