580
00:31:41,821 --> 00:31:50,560
One of the most versatile heavy machines is the backhoe.

581
00:31:50,561 --> 00:31:53,860
This backhoe arm is like that of an excavator,

582
00:31:53,861 --> 00:31:56,860
while the front plow is like that of a loader.

583
00:31:56,861 --> 00:32:00,900
And either appendage can be swapped out for other tools,

584
00:32:00,901 --> 00:32:04,900
like jackhammers or forklift forks specific to the job at hand.

585
00:32:04,901 --> 00:32:09,120
And it's for this reason it's often called the Swiss Army

586
00:32:09,121 --> 00:32:11,620
Knife of Construction Machinery.

587
00:32:11,621 --> 00:32:17,180
And its roots start with the legendary brand JCB.

588
00:32:17,181 --> 00:32:20,180
JCB is the third largest construction equipment

589
00:32:20,181 --> 00:32:23,960
manufacturer in the world, named after its founder,

590
00:32:23,961 --> 00:32:26,680
Mr. Joseph Cyril Bamford.

591
00:32:26,681 --> 00:32:30,320
JCB was founded back in 1945.

592
00:32:30,321 --> 00:32:33,460
Our first product being a tipping trailer from War Scrap

593
00:32:33,461 --> 00:32:34,960
from World War II.

594
00:32:34,961 --> 00:32:36,960
The tipping trailer was the predecessor

595
00:32:36,961 --> 00:32:39,300
to today's backhoe.

596
00:32:39,301 --> 00:32:42,440
We invented the backhoe loader back in 1953.

597
00:32:42,441 --> 00:32:44,940
And today, one out of every two backhoe sold globally.

598
00:32:44,941 --> 00:32:47,940
That's over 40,000 machines a year.

